{"id":"msg_m_ex_diesel_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_diesel","label":"Diesel · Nikke"},"label":"2. Hey!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_diesel_01","next":"msg_m_ex_diesel_03","speakers":{"diesel":"Diesel"},"icons":{"diesel":"si_c072_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_1","text":"Hey!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_2","text":"Are you busy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_3","text":"No, I'm not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_4","text":"Nice, hehehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_5","text":"Can I confide in you for a second?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_6","text":"It's nothing serious, but...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_7","text":"Tell me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_8","text":"I heard Tetra will be holding","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_9","text":"idol auditions soon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_10","text":"Have you heard about this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_11","text":"Not yet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_12","text":"Well, it's what they call","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_13","text":"a 'blind audition'.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_14","text":"The judges make their selection purely based on your skill.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_15","text":"I was considering throwing my hat in the ring.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_16","text":"The only thing is, I'm not sure whether to focus on dancing or singing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_17","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_17","text":"Singing","jump":"m_ex_diesel_02_19"},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_18","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_18","text":"Dancing","jump":"m_ex_diesel_02_23"},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_19","text":"So you think singing is a better choice?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_20","text":"I've actually written a song","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_21","text":"but I want to dance as well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_22","text":"Ugh, I can't decide!","jump":"m_ex_diesel_02_27"},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_23","text":"Since singing is the most fundamental skill for any idols,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_24","text":"don't you think that it would be better to show off some dance skills?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_25","text":"Ugh, I can't decide!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_26","text":"To be honest, I've actually written a song.","jump":"m_ex_diesel_02_27"},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_27","text":"Your own song?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_28","text":"Yep, I call this peppy little ditty,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_29","text":"The Journey Together (with AZX).","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_30","text":"Why don't you choreograph a dance to the song?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_31","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_32","text":"Why didn't I think of that?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_33","text":"That's a perfect solution!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_34","text":"Thanks, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_35","text":"I'll show you the dance the next time we meet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_36","text":"Can't wait to see it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_37","text":"I have to wait until the right time to show you the dance.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_38","text":"Otherwise, it won't be any good!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_39","text":"Hehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_40","text":"You'll just have to wait till then, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_41","text":"All right, it's decided then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_42","text":"I should hurry and start practicing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_02_43","text":"I'll be in touch when I pass the audition!","jump":null}],"chat":true}